  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU funded activities (2019-2023)by the European Commission for the control of Foot and Mouth Disease</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall Objective:  Increase  resilience of livelihoods to threats and crises (FAO SO5, REUR Regional Initiative 3) (Impact)   
Specific Objective: Decrease FAST disease risk in the European neighborhood enabling better trade conditions and higher food security prospects for European stakeholders in the livestock sector (Outcome)
Objectives by Pillars  
P.I    Improved preparedness for FAST DISEASE crises management by Member States
P.II  Reduce risk to Members from the European neighborhood: Progressive Control in neighboring regions.
P.III Increase implementation of the global strategy for the Progressive control of FMD.</narrative>
  </description>
